{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-034.md","record_count":12,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s034-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"பத்மாவதி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அமைச்சரே! மகாராஜாவையே கேளுங்கள், என்ன சொல்கிறாரென்று!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"manohara-s034-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"சத்யசீலா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மகாராஜா இதையெல்லாம் கவனிக்கவே மாட்டார்—","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"manohara-s034-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"பத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மனோகரனை நினைத்தால் எனக்கு பயமாயிருக்கிறது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"manohara-s034-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"சத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பயப்படத்தேவையில்லை-நான் பார்த்துக்கொள்கிறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"manohara-s034-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"வ. சே","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மகாராஜா கவனிக்கமாட்டார்... மனோகரனுக்கு பயப்படத் தேவையில்லை","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"manohara-s034-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"அரசர்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"(நிலவைப் பார்த்தபடி) களங்கம்...களங்கம்! என் பரம்பரையிலேயே இல்லாத களங்கம்! பாதகி!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"manohara-s034-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"வ. சே","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ப்ரபு! அமைதியாக இருங்கள்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"manohara-s034-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அமைதி! அவளுடைய சாவிலேதான் எனக்கு அமைதி!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"manohara-s034-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"வ. சே","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இதைக் கேளுங்கள் மகாராஜா! மகாராணி......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"manohara-s034-d010","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மகாராணி......மறுபடியும் சொல்லாதே! மானமிழந்தவள்! நாடோடி...வேசி! வசந்தி! நீயே உத்திரவிடு! அவளைப் பாதாள சிறையில் போடவேண்டும்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"manohara-s034-d011","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"வ. சே","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணியைச் சிறையில் போடுவதால் உங்கள் ஆத்திரம் அடங்கும். வசந்த விழாவில் தாயைக் குறை கூறினேன் என்று தாண்டி விழுந்தானே, மனோகரன்! இப்போது என்ன சொல்கிறான்? மன்னிப்பு கேட்டுக்கொள்வானா என்னிடம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"manohara-s034-d012","scene_id":"manohara-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"அர","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கேட்கச் சொல்லுகிறேன்... உன்னை எதிர்த்துப் பேசியதற்கு கொலு மண்டபத்திலேயே மன்னிப்பு கேட்கச் சொல்லுகிறேன். பத்மாவதிக்குச் சிறைச் சாலை! மனோகரன் வசந்த சேனையிடம் மன்னிப்பு கேட்க வேண்டும்......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"}]}